# Keep small, reviewable synthetic fixtures and summaries versioned.
# Do not add blanket ignores for data/synthetic/, evals/datasets/, or evals/reports/.
# Versioned evidence should live outside ignored raw folders, for example:
# evals/manifests/, evals/results/summaries/, artifacts/traces/samples/.
# Each summary must point to the run configuration, source commit, checksums, and
# external/local raw-artifact location when the raw payload is not committed.
# If an ignored generated directory is introduced later, add an explicit !path/.gitkeep
# rule only when that empty directory is required by the application.

